// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Alec_Parson 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Alec Parson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1199905329" "Alec Parson"
// ProfessionString :
"P3777807512" "Senior Researcher at MICIR, the Ministry of Intelligence Criminal Investigaton and Research."
// DescriptionString :
"P1960578088" "Alec Parson is a senior forensic scientist working for MICIR, the Ministry of Information Criminal Investigation and Research. He has a passion for robotics and all things Clockwork related."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4205582685" "<color orange>You get Parson's voice mail</color> Hi, you've reached Alec Parson. I'm probably neck deep in some sort of investigation right now, but I'll be sure to return your call as soon as I'm able. Have a great day."
// LocationString :
"P553041384" "Imperial City"
// HelloString :
"P3650671693" "I have very little time to talk right now.  There is so much code to compile, I might as well be a Verbrandt string-assistant. Sigh"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2105259717" "If you're not here about the double-locked algorithm arrays that I requested, then I have no idea who you are or why you're here."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P813426096" "I checked with the registry and I didn't see mention of your name. Listen, I don't want to get written up or anything, so get yourself registered with Powers Division."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2035757072" "You must be {HeroName} that was mentioned in the email.  I'm Alec Parson, and I'm in charge of taking care of our city's security clockwork drones.  Did you know that just one optical pattern recognition sensor on a Class G-22029 pre-production model creates more analogous cognitive feedback than ten officers combined?<br><br>Can you imagine it?  If enough of these were installed around the city, we could let these robots take over all the policing duties!  All I need to do is track down a few annoying bugs and then the system will be foolproof!<br><br>Of course, that isn't exactly possible right now. I could use your help."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3861204565" "I'm still working on some coding changes to prevent anyone from tampering with our clockworks again.  If I need anything, I'll let you know."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2823989360" "Your schedule is as packed as tightly as a 64k compiler.  Come back when you've finished your tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1687444864" "Although I could use your help, you'll need to match my access by being Security Level SecurityLevel."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P353106331" "It appears we'll be working together more. Here, please take my cell number. It's my preferred way of communication."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3941971911" "You have a good eye in catching technical aspects most people would ignore.  I'd definitely like to work again with you in the future, friend."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P3760090606" "I want you to talk to a guy down at M.I.C.I.R. by the name of Parson. Real bright guy, has helped me crack more than a few cases that stumped everyone else. He's a big robotics buff. He's been working some cases on hacked Clockwork, I figure he could use your help, especially when it comes to getting those Clockwork out of Resistance hands in order to study them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2022483603" "This contact I've introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you've chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2557049975" "I've got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


