// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Beholder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2961092773" "Beholder"
// ProfessionString :
"P2396680222" "Former Seer"
// DescriptionString :
"P1888739277" "Beholder is a rare sight to see - a seer who escaped from the control of Praetor Tilman. She believes that she has a short lease on life and goes to great lengths to ensure anyone who deals with her knows this."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2183954863" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Beholder.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P4134713753" "Underground Imperial City"
// HelloString :
"P1687261335" "Time is running out, {HeroName}. For all of us."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2979640601" "I can hear you thinking, hear you talking. But it's not time for us to speak yet. Go away."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3954940635" "You've got some strange thoughts floating around in your head, {HeroName}. Maybe you should find someone to show you around so you don't get picked up by the <i>Praetorian</i> Police Department."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4173992951" "I hear it all, {HeroName}. Hatchet's thoughts of his pet. Vagabond's confused memories swirling around, Wardog's knowledge of history. I hear it all and I know it's going to end soon for me. Perhaps for all of us. You're here speaking to me now because I'm aware of your power, of your ability, and of your ability to push morals aside. You are the exact person I need help from. Let's get started with the destruction, shall we?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3151831176" "Our time is finished for now, {HeroName}. All that's left is to wait until the end."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3372881411" "Your mind is wracked with various tasks to do. Clear your mind and come speak with me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2291949333" "I hear doubt from people who think they can't accomplish a task.  It is very sad, because they are right.  But they don't know they will come back later when they can."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// WrongAllianceString :
"P363080075" "Don't bother talking with me unless you're willing to devote yourself to this cause, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P2499554728" "Beholder is a former Seer. She hasn't told any of us how long she was actually a Seer, or how long she has left to live, but neither answer is good. She's a woman who makes good use of her time, so be careful not to waste any of it. She has a habit of getting very angry very fast."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P498559843" "With all that said and done, Vagabond wants your help in moving things forward here in the underground."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1205012978" "Beholder can be a cold woman, but that's the kind of person we need to handle the situation we're in."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P221983545" "Do you want to meet with Vagabond now?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


