// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Chance_McKnight 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Chance McKnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1736376830" "Chance McKnight"
// ProfessionString :
"P2752740627" "Undercover Ministry of Intelligence operative in the Syndicate"
// DescriptionString :
"P4256931683" "Chance McKnight is one of the most dedicated officers in the Ministry of Intelligence. He's taken on the responsibility of going undercover into the Syndicate, doing questionable acts that go against everything he believes in in order to get a chance to accomplishing something greater; the arrest of the Syndicate's shadowy leaders. For the past six months McKnight has worked his way up the ladder of leadership and is very close to accomplishing his goal."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P684473147" "<color orange>Chance McKnight's number has been disconnected.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P615648224" "What's the situation?"
// HelloString :
"P1014176993" "You got something for me?"
// HelloString :
"P1031088448" "Anything to report?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2145527759" "You tryin' to get me killed?"
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3733207963" "Nobody mentioned anything about you to me. You should find someone to watch after you before you get yourself killed."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3192544518" "Welcome to the gray before the black, {HeroName}. You can't judge what we do here, only the results. To do so would compromise everything we are working for and jeopardize us all.<br><br>The best thing to do is forget everything you know and just do what it takes to survive. That's the mentality of the people we're infiltrating, they have no greater aspirations than to elevate themselves over others. You will need to embrace that ideology if you hope to get to the top of the Syndicate... or rather, a fragment of what was once the Syndicate.<br><br>It's an all out war, and we're in the middle of it. I'm already deep into the organization, but follow my lead and we'll do well together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1276906060" "I'm off the case and working on another one. Sinclair wants to keep me for another three months to see what else I can do here. Man I miss my wife and kids..."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P153494512" "I need your total focus on this operation, {HeroName}. Take care of some of your other tasks and then come talk to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1025492309" "This operation is extremely dangerous. I can't use you until you are at least Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1589217236" "Listen, here's my phone number. Call me from now on. I'm worried that Octavian or Masamoto's men might track you back to me and take me out since they can't seem to take you down."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3542532289" "You cracked this case wide open, {HeroName}. Once this is over, I'm out of undercover and I get to see my wife and kids again. I'll invite you over sometime for dinner and to meet the misses. I'm glad we got the opportunity to work together."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1903261138" "You think you've seen how ugly this can get, {HeroName}? Well, you haven't seen anything until you've gone undercover.<br><br>I don't know how those guys in the Ministry can handle it, but I guess that's what lets them walk that fine line, just on the edge of the law.<br><br>I've gotten word that one of our inside men has requested Powers Division aid. Your name came up, so I'm sending you over to him. He's working inside the Syndicate, so try not to get spotted or months of work could get turn to vapor in an instant."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


