// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Chimera 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Praetor Sinclair 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P119625627" "Praetor Sinclair"
// ProfessionString :
"P2568636875" "Praetor"
// DescriptionString :
"P111561932" "Justin Sinclair is a man that few would dare to cross. He is known for having his hand in all matters within Praetoria and is trusted by Emperor Cole himself to run various covert operations, both in Praetoria and outside of it."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P177624793" "We have very little time to waste, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P4244395452" "Let's begin, there's much to do."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3322786826" "Do you ever get that feeling that there was something you forgot?  For instance, you don't know me yet you still interrupted me.  Now, what do you think you forgot? Go deal with that first, then perhaps attempt to speak with me."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1273377512" "You're something of an enigma, {HeroName}. I can't find any record of you in our databases. But since a spy would have taken the effort to infiltrate Powers Division, I can only assume that you somehow slipped through the Ministry's fingers. Do us all a favor andregister with Powers Division. You wouldn't want me to have you brought in for questioning."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4007702356" "Your name is {HeroName}. I've been keeping track of your progress, ever since I received your information from Ms. Baker. I have to say, I'm very impressed. I'm well aware of what your motives might be; power, fame, glory, all or perhaps just one. Or perhaps you're actually here to protect the people and get famous while doing so. It doesn't matter to me.<br><br>I am a man who knows how to work with others. Today, I require your aid. In return, I will give you what you need. Money, power, fame, whatever it is. But you must know that what I deal with is extremely sensitive and must not be released to the public. I am putting my trust towards you, the trust of a Praetor. Do not take it lightly."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2435800231" "You and I have finished our business, {HeroName}. Let's not have it linger."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3799890121" "The key to being a Praetor is balancing your tasks. You do not have that mastered, not as of yet."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P817323207" "Though I'm certain there are a lot of people on the force who would disagree with me, you're no use to me dead.  I'm not sending you out on anything until you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2283148698" "I'm only going to speak with those who are willing to do what it takes to move forward, {HeroName}. Speak to me when you've gained that will."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1985015120" "Praetor Sinclair is considered to be the most powerful man within Imperial City. If there's anything happening within the city, he knows about it. He wishes to speak to you about matters that he needs help in dealing with."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1152203124" "Praetor Sinclair would be happy to speak with you, provided that you go through me, of course."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


