// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doorman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2554197466" "Doorman"
// ProfessionString :
"P1076586633" "Guardian of First Ward"
// DescriptionString :
"P2712275081" "Leon Varris is one of the more well-known members of the Carnival of Light outside of First Ward, as he is one of the primary representatives of the Carnival to the Resistance. As such, he is one of those responsible for keeping the lines of communication open between his leaders and theirs. Additionally, Vanessa DeVore entrusted him with the duty of Guardian of First Ward, and he maintains a constant vigil over the doorway leading between Underground Imperial City and First Ward. Over time, this lead to his acquisition of the sobriquet, 'Doorman,' from the Resistance."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2116187179" "I cannot reveal my secrets to you at this time.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP or purchase the First Ward from the Paragon Market in order to access this contact."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2956772384" "I will not stop you from entering First Ward, but the Carnival will not work with just anyone."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3757384328" "If DeVore's divinations are true, then there are greater threats that require the attention of one as powerful as you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3039383450" "One should only proceed through a door if they have a purpose in doing so, and right now you have far too much doing to have much of a purpose going anywhere else. Refocus and then we shall see where your purpose will take you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4138131411" "You have spirit, but you are not yet powerful to face the dangers that await you beyond this door. Come back when you have achieved Security Level 20 and then your strength can be of use."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1038892311" "Friendship is a rare thing to find this close to Nowhere. I welcome yours."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P622770575" "The fates have yet to decide if you are destined for greatness, but to me it is obvious. If you have want of anything, I will do all I can to aid you."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P4082129103" "I consider none to be my enemy, but something about you has me concerned. I will not help you, I am sorry."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P727066292" "The Doorman stands vigil over a door in the Imperial City Underground. Few are the people who come through it, but the rumors abound that it leads to the devastated ruins of First Ward, a city destroyed by the Devouring Earth and abandoned save for the Mother of Mercy Psychiatric Hospital."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3221421024" "Talk to The Doorman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DoormanDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Fallback Text :
"P2484752208" "Something is wrong. We cannot speak at this time."
// Answer Text :
"P63996380" "Ok"
// Page PrimalHero Text :
"P289110143" "Mistress Eva sent you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2986516177" "She said the people of First Ward needed my help."
// Page PrimalHeroPage1 Text :
"P1455317859" "First Ward is a place that does not exist for your average Praetorian citizen. It is a place where those who would upset the status quo of Praetoria are taken to disappear. This is why some call it <i>Nowhere</i>.<br><br>It's more than just the people of First Ward who need your help, {HeroName}. All of Praetoria may be in grave danger."
// Answer Text :
"P2889234579" "Grave danger? Back up, tell me what's going on!"
// Page PrimalHeroPage2 Text :
"P137904241" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2905169901" "What evil is behind this chaos?"
// Page PrimalHeroPage3 Text :
"P300629482" "You must look beyond the labels of good and evil in First Ward, {HeroName}. The only way to put an end to this chaos is to come together, one and all. If we stay divided then we shall all surely fall."
// Answer Text :
"P2992410800" "What are you saying, exactly?"
// Page PrimalHeroPage4 Text :
"P706475091" "You have been chosen by Mistress Eva not because of your loyalties but because you are strong enough to change the tide before it is too late for us all.<br><br>The Carnival has recruited others who are just as strong to help. We must all come together to face this threat before it is too late."
// Answer Text :
"P3740342629" "Then you've recruited Praetorians and Villains?"
// Page PrimalHeroPage5 Text :
"P3356112087" "You will find that in First Ward where you came from matters less than what you can contribute.<br><br>You do not have to work directly with those you would call enemy, but if we are to prevail then maintaining neutral relations will suffice.<br><br>We can use all the help we can get."
// Answer Text :
"P3831592965" "This sounds serious, I will help in whatever way I can."
// Page PrimalHeroPage6 Text :
"P3790141644" "I knew I could count on you from the moment we first met.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P3202335702" "It sounds as if there is little time to lose."
// Answer Text :
"P620814622" "This is a lot to take in at once. I need a minute."
// Page PrimalVillain Text :
"P405332901" "Mordesen hired you, I presume?"
// Answer Text :
"P3277936822" "And what if he did?"
// Answer Text :
"P304372247" "The money means nothing! Who do I destroy?"
// Answer Text :
"P1559695565" "Get to the point, why am I here?"
// Page PrimalVillainPage1Cagey Text :
"P2190906145" "There is no need to play cagey, {HeroName}. I have no interest in betraying you, quite the contrary. Your strength would be unwise to oppose and it is that very strength that we in the Carnival have need of."
// Answer Text :
"P866438654" "What have you heard?"
// Answer Text :
"P2119537075" "That's right, it would be foolish to test my strength."
// Answer Text :
"P1530221768" "I'm listening..."
// Page PrimalVillainPage2Cagey Text :
"P161523934" "What I've heard will matter less than what is true. If your strength is as great as I've heard, then you have nothing to worry about."
// Answer Text :
"P3721132669" "You let me worry about that, what's on your mind?"
// Answer Text :
"P2006524313" "My strength is not in question, why I'm here is."
// Answer Text :
"P1806753053" "Let's cut to the chase."
// Page PrimalVillainPage3Cagey Text :
"P1754402532" "First Ward is a place that does not exist for your average Praetorian citizen. It is a place where those who would upset the status quo of Praetoria are taken to disappear. This is why some call it <i>Nowhere</i>.<br><br>You have come before me not because of loyalties but because you are strong enough to change the tide before it is too late for us all."
// Answer Text :
"P3256812567" "That sounds dicey... what's your angle?"
// Answer Text :
"P876451753" "The weak should perish to make way for the strong."
// Answer Text :
"P2808009042" "Go on..."
// Page PrimalVillainPage4Cagey Text :
"P453002137" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color><br><br>My angle is that I, like you, want to survive this. But the only way to ensure that is to work together, or, at the very least, not against one another.<br><br>You were recruited for your cunning as well as your strength, so I know that you and I see eye to eye on this."
// Answer Text :
"P1283363539" "Right, dying last means I still die. I get it."
// Page PrimalVillainPage5Cagey Text :
"P38706163" ""You will find that in First Ward where you came from matters less than what you can contribute.<br><br>You do not have to work directly with those you would call enemy, but if we are to prevail then maintaining neutral relations will suffice.<br><br>We can use all the help we can get."
// Answer Text :
"P4022448086" "Alright, I'm in. But I don't like it."
// Page PrimalVillainPage6Cagey Text :
"P2742233333" "You don't have to like it.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P1995231486" "Jester huh? He sounds like a decent fellow."
// Answer Text :
"P386324584" "Let me tie up a few loose ends first, alright?"
// Page PrimalVillainPage1Murderous Text :
"P3714436074" "I have been told that your appetite for destruction is great. Well in First Ward there is a lot that needs to be destroyed. More to the point, it is what we don't want destroyed that is important.<br><br>Rest assured, your bloodlust will be more than sated and your strength tested to the breaking point."
// Answer Text :
"P2568871060" "None can oppose my strength! Bring them on!"
// Page PrimalVillainPage2Murderous Text :
"P4037724145" "First Ward is a place where the strong survive and the weak perish, but there is a new threat that threatens to destroy everything.<br><br>You have come before me not because of loyalties but because you are strong enough to change the tide before it is too late for us all."
// Answer Text :
"P1009709622" "I shall crush this enemy!"
// Page PrimalVillainPage3Murderous Text :
"P1424021084" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color> Not even you, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P3815638543" "You dare question my strength!?"
// Page PrimalVillainPage4Murderous Text :
"P3498660802" "Your strength is formidable, and I know that you can defeat this growing threat, but we must act quickly and unified in its destruction. I ask that you ignore your former loyalties, for they do not exist in First Ward. All that matters there is strength and deeds. Prove your strength and none shall oppose you."
// Answer Text :
"P148072495" "Yes, I -WILL- prove that I am the strongest!"
// Page PrimalVillainPage5Murderous Text :
"P3888738521" "Good.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He can fill you in on the details."
// Answer Text :
"P1732152748" "Jester sounds like a coward."
// Page PrimalVillainPage6Murderous Text :
"P3791419559" "Not a coward at all. Jester has survived in First Ward longer than any other. He has knowledge that will make you an even more formidable opponent. It would be wise to hear his words.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P1039642503" "I am ready for anything!"
// Answer Text :
"P1037826904" "I will go when I am ready, not before!"
// Page PrimalVillainPage1Direct Text :
"P2840979954" "First Ward is a place that does not exist for your average Praetorian citizen. It is a place where those who would upset the status quo of Praetoria are taken to disappear. This is why some call it <i>Nowhere</i>.<br><br>You have come before me because you are strong enough to change the tide before it is too late for us all."
// Page PrimalVillainPage2Direct Text :
"P184776659" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color><br><br>You see now why we wanted you?"
// Answer Text :
"P3249462832" "I do. But there is more... Tell me."
// Page PrimalVillainPage3Direct Text :
"P3988765692" "We cannot allow this chaos to spread. As such we have not limited our recruitment to individuals of your nature..."
// Answer Text :
"P2309719119" "You've recruited Heroes from Paragon City, haven't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2748556218" "If those idiots play by the rules, then so will I..."
// Page PrimalVillainPage5Direct Text :
"P2321931029" "Good to hear.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P4081378399" "By all means, I can't wait."
// Answer Text :
"P513655426" "I'll let you know."
// Page Loyalist Text :
"P3007842693" "No need for violence between us, {HeroName}. Listen to what I say before you pass sentence."
// Answer Text :
"P2134212019" "Give me a good reason not to arrest you."
// Answer Text :
"P307321372" "I got bigger fish to fry, pal. Why am I here?"
// Page LoyalistPage1Responsible Text :
"P2848927076" "The lies you have heard about First Ward are not all true, {HeroName}. But know this, there is more going on than Tilman's Seer Program. Far more, and all of it unsettling."
// Answer Text :
"P596176582" "Why are you telling me this and why should I believe you?"
// Page LoyalistPage2Responsible Text :
"P1809079223" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color><br><br>I'm not asking you to believe me, {HeroName}. I want you to see it for yourself."
// Answer Text :
"P1723416182" "If what you say is true, then people are in danger. Yes?"
// Page LoyalistPage4Responsible Text :
"P2686456900" "All of Praetoria is in danger, {HeroName}. I'm not asking you to change your loyalties, I'm asking you to set them aside for the common good of us all. If we fail here, then who was loyal won't matter anymore, only who was lucky enough to die first."
// Answer Text :
"P3032625880" "What do you want me to do?"
// Page LoyalistPage5Responsible Text :
"P755488105" "All I ask is that you trust your own eyes.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P1292604319" "Alright, I'll do it."
// Answer Text :
"P2777531474" "Give me a minute here."
// Page LoyalistPage1Power Text :
"P2646658647" "Why are you here?<br><br>You're kidding, right?<br><br>Why wouldn't you be here?<br><br>{HeroName}, you're the biggest name since Marcus Cole. You're the first person we thought of when we realized we needed help in saving the world."
// Answer Text :
"P393603639" "Saving the world? Back up, there, chief."
// Page LoyalistPage2Power Text :
"P1932793580" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color><br><br>Except for you.<br><br>The world needs you, {HeroName}. We need you."
// Answer Text :
"P2639909578" "Who else knows about this?"
// Page LoyalistPage3Power Text :
"P67692190" "Your strength is formidable, and I know that you can defeat this growing threat, but we did not know if you would be willing to hear us out..."
// Answer Text :
"P1629863067" "So you recruited some competition?"
// Page LoyalistPage4Power Text :
"P895731643" "They are allies, {HeroName}. Whether you choose to team up with them is your business and your business alone. All we ask is that you do not risk the safety of the world by losing focus on the true enemy, the chaos that threatens to consume us all."
// Answer Text :
"P3534277207" "I play well with others, so long as they remember I'm the best."
// Page LoyalistPage5Power Text :
"P3367700334" "You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P3032550350" "I'm always ready."
// Answer Text :
"P3529070516" "I'll get back to you on that one."
// Page Resistance Text :
"P200897870" "The Carnival has need of your help, {HeroName}. The Resistance, perhaps even all of Praetoria is in grave danger."
// Answer Text :
"P202087617" "What danger do you speak of?"
// Answer Text :
"P3124812413" "Point me at the enemy and I'll take care of the rest."
// Page ResistancePage1Warden Text :
"P3621284222" "Something powerful has happened in the First Ward. It has become a nexus point of chaos. <color orange>If that chaos is allowed to take root, then there may be nothing in this world, or any other, that can stop it.</color><br><br>The conspiracies are true. First Ward is a place that does not exist for your average Praetorian citizen. It is a place where those who would upset the status quo of Praetoria are taken to disappear. This is why some call it <i>Nowhere</i>.<br><br>You have come before me not because of loyalties but because you are strong enough to change the tide before it is too late for us all."
// Answer Text :
"P826832052" "I'll do everything in my power, but will it be enough?"
// Page ResistancePage2Warden Text :
"P3904181188" "I believe so, but not everyone in the Carnival feels the same way. We've gathered others to our cause, some of whom you may consider enemies."
// Answer Text :
"P1616644222" "What makes you think those loyal to Cole will help?"
// Answer Text :
"P3508751881" "Alright, for the good of Praetoria we have little choice."
// Page ResistancePage4Warden Text :
"P2293603645" "Believe me, I understand your hesitation, but as you said, we have little choice.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P1839120955" "I'm ready."
// Answer Text :
"P1927296798" "I'm not ready to go yet."
// Answer Text :
"P1538423238" "If this is as bad as you claim, let's use it against Tyrant!"
// Page ResistancePage2Crusader Text :
"P3119025310" "If we could we would have, but there is no controlling it. We must work together to stamp it out now.<br><br>All of us must work together..."
// Answer Text :
"P3900720006" "Are you suggesting we work with Tyrant's cronies!?"
// Page ResistancePage3Crusader Text :
"P851864468" "Only so far as we have to.<br><br>Hear my words, {HeroName}. This is bigger than all of us. If we don't stop it, I don't know who will.<br><br>You must put aside your differences. Whether you work with them is your decision, but working against them will do nothing but get us all killed."
// Answer Text :
"P272837886" "Fine. But once this is over. They. Will. Pay!"
// Page ResistancePage4Crusader Text :
"P822152742" "You will find that in First Ward where you came from matters less than what you can contribute.<br><br>You're going to need to talk to Jester. He's the first person to have been exiled to First Ward that wasn't a Seer in Praetor Tilman's Seer Program. He can fill you in on the details.<br><br>When you are ready to proceed to First Ward, let me know."
// Answer Text :
"P712638662" "Jester, sure. Sounds like a cool dude."
// Answer Text :
"P593928812" "I got a few things to take care of first."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


