// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Steffard 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doctor Steffard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3879875617" "Doctor Steffard"
// ProfessionString :
"P1431241813" "Neurologist and Cybernetics Expert "
// DescriptionString :
"P1272568445" "Dr. Steffard is an expert on super powered physiology as well as a specialist in cybernetic implantation and neurology. He is a well known face amongst the Powers Division as he is one of the senior medical officials on the examination board which checks out each new member of Powers Division before admitting them into the organization."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3223867890" "<color orange>Dr. Steffard's phone rings but you get an automated voice mail indicating that he is on vacation.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P423178987" "Hey {Hero.gender=male buddy|there}."
// HelloString :
"P3356752013" "How're ya feeling?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4290698412" "I'm not actually seeing patients right now. Are you sure you aren't looking for someone else, I haven't received a referral about you."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3446917288" "I don't recall your specific power combinations, but, there are so many recruits into Powers Division these days that it is entirely possible I simply forgot. Despite that, I would not have forgotten to fill out your paperwork. I'm afraid I'm going to have to ask you to speak with the Ministry of Intelligence on the matter."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3197826337" "I'm Dr. Steffard, but everyone just drops the doctor part. I've worked in neuroscience for twenty-two years now and I have only one thing to say about the Seer Project: It's immoral.<br><br>Sure, they do a great service, but at what cost? I took an oath to do more good than harm with any patient, and right now I see a lot of women in pain, and an opportunity to do a lot of good."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P51422297" "I can't believe that Emperor Cole could willingly allow such a travesty against human life to float there for all to see. Either he's blind, or being blinded. I'm not sure which, if any, is more comforting. I'm going to do my darndest to remedy this outrageous practice of enslaving girls to the city like they're some sort of traffic camera. And all just because they're born different."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1035298651" "I'm interested in working with you, {HeroName}, but you're really busy at the moment. If you can free up your task list then I'll be more confident that you can dedicate the time I feel is necessary to the job at hand."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4062835692" "Come back when you're Security Level {Level}, {HeroName}. I've worked with Powers Division for five years now, so trust me when I say that this is a little out of your power rating."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1387354682" "Call me from now on, it's a secure line which means it is safer for both of us."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P564966607" "I have to admit, I wasn't sure if I was going to be able to count on you, {HeroName}. Most people don't even notice the Seers anymore, so I am pleasantly surprised that you are interested in figuring out if there is a link here between the Seers and the Ghouls."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P2438515143" "You may have met Dr. Steffard before, I know that he assists Powers Division regularly what with his studies on super power origins and what not. Well, he's got a good head on his shoulders and we've discussed a lot of pretty dangerous politics lately. I want you to meet with him and talk to him. I'm sure learning that there are those in the division who sympathize with our movement will make him happy."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


