// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Hatchet 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Hatchet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P96966178" "Hatchet"
// ProfessionString :
"P3706694824" "Ghoul Tamer"
// DescriptionString :
"P4161602911" "Hatchet is known for one thing - his taming of ghouls. His pet ghoul, 'Marty', makes many people in the Resistance nervous, but he insists those that are nervous simply haven't conquered their own fear of death. This does not alleviate anyone's fear."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P4234234668" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Hatchet.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1184482714" "Let's look at the face of death and laugh, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3879573175" "You've got me mistaken with someone else, I'm not the person you're looking for.  Why don't you go talk with a contact you already know rather than bothering an old war vet."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1123747220" "Not from around here, are ya? Listen, want some advice? Go find someone to watch your back, ain't safe down here."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1418126211" "Good to meet you, {HeroName}. I've heard many things about you. They all point to one thing; you're someone who knows how to get things done. That is the kind of person we need here in the Resistance. There are too many people within our group who aren't willing to take the <i>necessary</i> steps to take down Cole. The fact that you're talking to me means you're willing to do what it takes. We've got a plan, a really big plan, {HeroName}. Let's see if we both live long enough to see it through."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1986293349" "Any minute that devil Tyrant is gonna hightail it and run after all we've done to him.  For now, we wait.  I'll let you know if I have any other orders for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3122655992" "You've got too many things on your plate, {HeroName}. Come back later."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1814439247" "I've got nothing for you now. Come back later, when you've become a little more powerful."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P3776746675" "<color orange>Hatchet remains silent.</color>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3603468861" "Now that we're done with our plan, there's someone who wants to meet you. You interested?"
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P245133773" "We've got ourselves a bona fide former Seer in our midst, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


