// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Interrogator_Kang 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Interrogator Kang 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1043589078" "Interrogator Kang"
// ProfessionString :
"P3963473481" "Interrogator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1323537998" "Ray Kang was on the Praetoria Police force day one. He's seen it all, from the revelry in the aftermath of the Hamidon Wars, through the reconstruction efforts, the birth of the Seer Program, the rise of the Syndicate, and the arrival of the Destroyers and Resistance. Kang has watched his city transform from utopia to warzone and he will do whatever it takes and sacrifice whatever is needed to return it to the utopia he helped build."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P1100136038" "<color orange>Kang's communicator is offline.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1042186655" "Hello there, what have you been up to lately?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2839122698" "Listen, I'm very busy working this case right now. Unless you've been assigned to me by someone like Washington, I'm afraid I'm not going to be able to devote time to you."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3451331068" "Powers Division hasn't mentioned anything about you to me, {HeroName}. You must be assigned to work with someone else, probably with another Powers Division member."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2469359159" "My name is Kang, Raymond Kang. I work for the Ministry of Intelligence as an interrogator. Ask around - when I have a question, it gets answered.<br> <br>But hey, I've got way more important things to talk about than myself."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3622128135" "I don't need your help right now, {HeroName}.  I've got a lot of 'clients' I need to meet with, but if anything alarming comes from our conversations, I'll be sure to get in touch with you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3113516849" "I'm not sure how things are run in Powers Division, but in the Ministry, we're given a case to work and that's it. You've got over half a dozen open assignments from what I've heard. Why don't you handle some of your business and then we can get down to business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2066947752" "I'm working a dangerous case, {HeroName}, come back when you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3977182682" "We're going to have to keep in touch if we're going to have any hope of solving this case. Here's my cell number. Call me whenever you get a lead. With coordination we will find Cutter Cain."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P688177600" "I've sacrificed a lot for this city, {HeroName}. I'm not going to let it get burnt down, not by us, not after we came so close to losing it all. There are too many things at stake right now for us to go back to the old ways. Those were dangerous times, when people like us were needed more than ever. Well, I think those times are coming again, but I'll be glad to have you right next to me when they do."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


