// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Investigator_Whitworth 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Investigator Whitworth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1598590089" "Investigator Whitworth"
// ProfessionString :
"P304216532" "Investigator for MICIR, the Ministry of Intelligence Criminal Investigation and Research."
// DescriptionString :
"P2209842717" "Whitworth is a member of the internal affairs branch of the Ministry of Intelligence. His job is to look in on the PPD and Ministries for signs of corruption, treason, and just plain bad apples. He does his job very well and is on a first name basis with Praetor Sinclair."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2614943765" "We've got work to do."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P856890627" "My reports on you are unsettlingly incomplete, {HeroName}.  If you'd like, we could sit down and have a casual chat.  If I was you, I'd choose to chat with {LastContactName} instead."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P204520242" "If I wasn't already busy I'd sit down and <i>investigate</i> exactly what happened to your Powers Division records. I suggest you find out before I'm put on the case."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4019503658" "Because you voluntarily chose to speak with me, rather than me having to hunt you down, we've gotten off to a good first step."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2900415860" "Praetoria is far more secure because of you, {HeroName}.  I know I can count on your help if our safety is once more threatened."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2600314155" "Do you think this is a joke, {HeroName}?  Do you think keeping the peace is something I like doing for kicks? Our work is serious, so you're going to need to take it seriously.  Come back when you've taken care of your other tasks, then I can take you seriously."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4061027411" "Your enthusiasm to help is being noted, but I can't accept your overly willing offer just yet.  Come back to me when you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P412754829" "We appreciate people like you who offer their help quite willingly, {HeroName}.  Feel free to get in touch with me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1756638079" "Do you realize that if we had more people like you in Praetoria, {HeroName}, we wouldn't have as much crime with all these gangs and outlaws."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P384655708" "Have you ever heard of Investigator Whitworth? The man is unsettling, but, I guess that's just because I'm an employee of M.I.C.I.R. and his job is to watch us like hawks. But that isn't what I wanted to tell you about him. He heard about you helping me out and said he wanted to meet you. If Whitworth needs your help it means someone made a very big mistake."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


