// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jessica_Flores 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jessica Flores 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2657666630" "Jessica Flores"
// ProfessionString :
"P1190926049" "Idealist"
// DescriptionString :
"P3903533815" "Jessica Flores is an independent investigative reporter whose agenda is uncovering the media's lies about the Resistance movement and showing people the truth of things. This is a dangerous job, however, and she has adopted several pen names under which she writes her articles in order to hide her identity. She hopes to one day crack the wall of censorship that TPN imposses over any and all stories involving the Resistance movement and its believers."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P1339679088" "<color orange>After a minute long sound byte from this week's most popular song you get Jessica's voicemail and a synthesized voice announcing that it is full.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3928968552" "Hi there!  I haven't seen your face around before."
// HelloString :
"P446302768" "Hey."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1304216849" "Sorry, but I have a policy of knowing a bit more about people before I discuss anything of real substance. It's nothing personal, just a precaution. You never know who might be listening in."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P4010404333" "You look kinda lost. You aren't going to do much good fighting the Destroyers or Syndicate if you can't find your way around town. Why don't you look for another Powers Division member who knows the city to show you around?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1725667202" "I'm Jessica Flores. I don't normally get to talk to you Powers Division types, so this is really exciting for me. I'd love to ask you a bunch of questions for an article I've been meaning to write, but right now I can't remember a single one of them. Ha ha, I'm such a dork sometimes. Do you have time to talk, maybe they'll come back to me if we just chat for a little while."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3248125141" "Everything's changed, the only thing I want right now is to make sure my boyfriend is ok. Please, keep fighting the good fight, and thank you, for everything."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P39403661" "I could really use a hand with a few things, but it looks like you're busy with other tasks.  Stop by when you've taken care of those, okay?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2157200200" "There are some important things that I could really use your help with, but I'm worried this might be a little too dangerous, even for someone like you.  Come back when you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P42992595" "If we keep working together to stop the injustices in this world, we might be able to take our future back.  Here is my number so that you can contact me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4198741297" "You're an inspiration to the Resistance, {HeroName}.  Without your help, the injustices of this government might have gone unchecked. Thank you for validating my belief that I'm doing something right."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


