// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mr._G 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mr. G 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3902314633" "Mr. G"
// ProfessionString :
"P1810970129" "Advisor"
// DescriptionString :
"P1941986182" "Mr. G is known to be an enigmatic man within the government of Praetoria. He also seems to know just what exactly is going on. Some say he has his pulse on everything that happens in Imperial City. Regardless of rumors, all of the people of Imperial trust Mr. G with their safety - and their lives."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1359560453" "Hello, {HeroName}. I'm quite certain you and I are going to work on something interesting, quite certain."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2900968442" "{HeroName}, I think you're getting ahead of yourself. You'll know when it's an appropriate time to speak with me.  Yes… you'll know."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P356335486" "Very intriguing. Very intriguing. Pardon me, but I must get in touch with my office regarding some <i>important new developments</i>."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3725932792" "You have such amazing potential, {HeroName}.  Amazing potential.  Be assured that I will call on you when I will need your unique talents again."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2608500879" "Your enthusiasm to help the fair people of Praetoria has been noticed, {HeroName}.  Continue with your tasks, then return to me when you feel it's an opportune time to assist me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1079718339" "I have some things specifically in mind for you, {HeroName}.  Specifially in mind.  However, you will need to be Security Level {Level} before I can entrust these tasks to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P726640359" "I believe the path you've taken doesn't suit our goals, {HeroName}. Let's speak again if you've had a change of heart, yes, let us indeed speak again."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2883093199" "The Transmuter will be able to move your fame and power forward with your very own group of Powers Division. It should prove very interesting. Very interesting indeed."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1133253874" "I think you'll get along very well with the man from Powers Division, very well."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FirstPage Text :
"P2216558985" "Ah, {HeroName}, I've heard a lot about you from Praetor White. He speaks very highly about your exploits, very highly.<br><br>Killing Jackhammer was no easy task, I imagine. But that's what makes you special amongst the powers here in Praetoria, very special.<br><br>My name is <color yellow>Mr. G</color>, you may or may not have heard of me. I deal in very special matters here in Praetoria, very special. Which is why I wish to deal with you, {HeroName}. I can see you becoming a very big deal here in Praetoria, very big deal. Which is why I would propose that you and I work together."
// Answer Text :
"P3496797732" "What do you want to work together on?"
// Page WorkTogether Text :
"P3758864623" "Several projects of mine, all very important. But the most important is analyzing you, what you can do, and how to heighten your abilities even more. To do this, however, I'll need your help in some matters that need to be handled in an efficient matter, a most efficient matter.<br><br>A deal for a deal, as they say. A man in my position in Praetoria has many matters to deal with, many matters. Your help in these matters wouldn't just help me, however. They would go a long way towards increasing your own fame in Praetoria, a very long way. So if you are truly interested in this, speak to me again. I suggest thinking it over, I would hate for you to rush into matters. Things can get quite messy if someone rushes into an issue, quite messy."
// Answer Text :
"P2301432738" "I might just do that, Mr. G."
// Page SecondPage Text :
"P1965609089" "{HeroName}, pleasure to meet you, quite a pleasure. My name is <color yellow>Mr. G.</color> I've heard a lot about your rise in the Powers Division. That was an excellent show you put on in the Magisterium, very excellent show.<br><br>I would like to propose that you and I begin a working relationship with each other. I am a man of some repute here in Praetoria, some repute indeed. You are a {Hero.gender=male man|woman} of growing power here in the city. Together, I think we can help each other get what we want."
// Answer Text :
"P875275018" "And what is it that you want?"
// Page WhatHeWants Text :
"P2793744548" "Many things, {HeroName}, many things. They aren't as ambitious as you, however. If they were, you would see me also fighting in the Magisterium, though I doubt I would survive for long, not for long at all. Which is why I would need your help.<br><br>The matters I deal with are public to the people of Praetoria, very public. The people may not know that <i>I</i> had anything to do with it, but they know of the people who helped me. Such as your 'friend', Reese. He and I worked together, though it was very unpleasant on my end to deal with him, very unpleasant. You and I working together can be much different, that I know.<br><br>I can see both of us benefitting from this. I can provide you with new sources of power, very new sources, along with the fame to move higher up in Praetoria. You can provide me with the assistance I need in dealing with various matters. Everyone wins in this scenario, {HeroName}, everyone. If you're interested in this, come back and speak to me. Think on it."
// Answer Text :
"P3338519412" "I'm ready now, Mr. G."
// Answer Text :
"P515170056" "I'll do that."
// Page ThirdPage Text :
"P596666986" "Hello there, {HeroName}. Very interesting to meet you, very interesting. I've heard somewhat of your achievements here in Praetoria. Not as much as some others, but you've been up there. The fact that you've come to speak to me speaks volumes about your tastes, volumes.<br><br>My name is <color yellow>Mr. G</color>, and I believe you and I have some very interesting matters to discuss, very interesting."
// Answer Text :
"P3941043679" "What sort of matters?"
// Page SortofMatters Text :
"P2935437144" "Matters of great importance, {HeroName}. A situation that I need your expert help with. Of course, I'm not a fool to believe you're in this just to help others. I am a man who is all about mutually assisting those who assist me. I have plenty of influence at my disposal within Praetoria, plenty of influence. I will make sure that you get whatever it is that you need; fame, power, glory, all or just one. I will help you, and you will help me - everyone benefits, {HeroName}, everyone. Think over my deal and get back to me when you are ready to make a move."
// Answer Text :
"P2977903288" "Alright, I'll do that."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


