"P2947551194" "Strange... memories... where are you... from?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1216513737" "<color orange>The Seer standing before you is different than the others. She's lacking her mask. A glazed look is in her eyes but you can clearly see a bead of sweat rolling from her forehead down her cheek. She appears to be concentrating intensely on something.<br><br>And then suddenly she looks directly at you with wide, pleading eyes."
