// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tami Baker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P162222773" "Tami Baker"
// ProfessionString :
"P2133487589" "Secretary"
// DescriptionString :
"P496724734" "Tami Baker is the personal secretary to Justin Sinclair, though she has been known to enforce his will when necessary. She has worked together many times with Mr. G in order to ensure the safety and prosperity of Imperial City."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3245885805" "Um.. oh! Hello {HeroName}!"
// HelloString :
"P3228800103" "I'm <i>really</i> excited for us to expand our opportunities here in Imperial city!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1307688156" "I'm looking through Praetor Sinclair's appointment calendar, and I don't see your name in here anywhere, {HeroName}.  I'm sorry, but neither I or Mr. Sinclair can see you at this time."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P914086376" "Listen, I'm searching the Ministry database on you and there is nothing. Must be some sort of glitch, or those bothersome Resistance did something to your records. Very bothersome."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4271871588" "I'm Tami Baker, and I take care of all of Mr. Sinclair's important scheduling needs.  He's not just a busy man, but a very important one, too!  Very important.  I've been asked by Justin to act as a - um, I mean Mr. Sinclair.  Um, what was I saying?  Oh yeah!  To act as a conduit, is what he said. I, um, totally help out Sinclair when he has, what're the words, other matters to attend to.<br> <br>Just to let you know, I'm acting under full authority of the Praetor.  Full authority.  So don't treat me like some bimbo who doesn't know what I'm talking about, you got that?<br><br>I know all about you {HeroName}, all about you, this 'non-bimbo' is fully in with regards to what's going on here in the big Imperial City, totally fully in. So what's say you and I get started! We're totally going to make some news in this place."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3496913171" "I haven't received anything more from Mr. Sinclair about you, {HeroName}.  If there are any more tasks, I'll be sure to give you a call."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2800983467" "Mr. Sinclair has given me another memo of things he needs you to do.  You'll need to clear your calendar of all other appointments before I can book you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2470943539" "I don't have time to be speaking with you right now, {HeroName}. Mr. Sinclair has had several emergencies crop up."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P4121897871" "Tami Baker is Praetor Sinclair's personal secretary. Because of that, she tends to have information on every little detail here in Imperial City. She also has been known to work with Mr. G. I'm almost inclined to say calling her a 'secretary' is limiting the scope of what she is actually capable of."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P404228122" "Tami Baker will be able to elevate you to a whole new level here in Imperial City."
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2165293284" "Let me know if you wish for me to set up a meeting with you and Praetor Sinclair."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


