// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Transmuter 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Transmuter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P258269641" "Transmuter"
// ProfessionString :
"P3631193682" "Former Mage"
// DescriptionString :
"P1521966672" "Transmuter was once a powerful mage who could turn material around him into anything he needed with a simple flick of his wrist. He even fought alongside Emperor Cole and Praetor White during the Hamidon Wars. Transmuter's magic was powered by his third eye and a magical medallion.<br><br>Transmuter's medallion was shattered by Reese, who smashed it into pieces during his induction into Powers Division. Reese was proclaimed the new 'Top Dog', while Transmuter was re-assigned to Imperial City. "
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2862864237" "Let's make some news, {HeroName}. We're destined for greatness."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3020028485" "Hrm, I think I've heard of you. {HeroName}. That's right. Well, I have nothing at all to speak with you about. I'd love to chat some more, but a man of my position is really busy. Why don't you try coming back later? Yes, you should do that."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P689833729" "I'm afraid I do not have the time to assist you. I would recommend finding someone else in Powers Division to aid you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1579409895" "You've gotten the attention of far too many people, {HeroName}. Finish up what you're working on, then come speak with me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P659885465" "I have some things specifically in mind for you, {HeroName}.  Specifically in mind.  However, you will need to be Security Level {Level} before I can entrust these tasks to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P4189863488" "Our two destinies aren't supposed to collide, {HeroName}, not while you value what you do."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1863766341" "The man's name is Transmuter. He was once a powerful mage who fought alongside Emperor Cole, but those days are far behind him now, far behind him. He is now in charge of the organization of Powers Division within Imperial City."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3667813058" "Let me know if you want me to get you in touch with Tami Baker."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FirstPage Text :
"P3643738574" "{HeroName}! So good to see you, really it's a pleasure. I'm sure Mr. G has gone at lengths to tell you about me. But it's only proper for me to introduce myself in person, yes? You can call me <color yellow>The Transmuter</color>, or Transmuter for short.<br><br>I have to say, I've heard <i>all</i> about you, ever since you put Reese in his place. Do you happen to know about the little...rivalry, Reese and I had?"
// Answer Text :
"P2425367328" "No...what was it?"
// Answer Text :
"P546208624" "I don't have time for stories. Let's get to the issue of Powers Division."
// Page Rivalry Text :
"P3782713415" "I'll tell you <i>all</i> about it. I used to be very high up there in Powers Division, you know. Not just sitting behind a desk all day long. <i>I</i> was one of the very first 'Top Dogs', as Praetor White would say. I participated all the time in our induction ceremonies, held in the Magisterium. I know you're very familiar with them.<br><br>Well, I was fighting Reese, when the scoundrel pulled a dirty trick and swept me off my feet. This wouldn't have been a problem, but he decided to play dirty and <i>destroyed</i> my precious medallion! This was the key to my magical powers, {HeroName}. Without it, I could not wield any magic at all. You can imagine my horror!<br><br>I assume you can see now why I'd be so willing to help you, given that <i>you</i> toppled Reese."
// Answer Text :
"P2717266386" "Paints a clearer picture, that's for sure. So, Powers Division...?"
// Page SecondPage Text :
"P1201205380" "Ah, {HeroName}, it's excellent that you've come to talk to me. Mr. G has told me all about you. My name is <color yellow>The Transmuter</color>, fighter of the Hamidon Wars, aid to Emperor Cole, organizer of Powers Division in Imperial City. The fact that you're here speaking to me now can only mean that Mr. G believes that I can help you, given my lofty position here in Imperial City.<br><br>Normally, I don't <i>help</i> regular people, I tell them what to do. But you, you're a bit different now, aren't you, {HeroName}? Saving Edward Polstra from those members of the Resistance, just to name one of the many things you've done. I can see you and I taking to the skies, lighting up Imperial City with our glory. Perhaps, we may even find a new source for my magical powers. Wouldn't that be something?"
// Answer Text :
"P1800647666" "Sure. Now, Mr. G said you'd be providing me with a squad...?"
// Page Powers Text :
"P586023807" "Yes! We've been looking for a candidate to lead a group of Powers Division. Normally, we allow the Powers Division to do whatever they want, but Praetor White wants to show Emperor Cole the true, united might of the Powers Division. Who better to do that than you?<br><br>I'm sure you'll be familiar with your team. They are <color yellow>Riptide, Zane, Aria, Stern, and Warrant</color>. All of them are eager to be working with you. When you're ready, come speak to me and we can begin our - ah - your operations here in Imperial City."
// Answer Text :
"P2214993994" "I'm ready to go now."
// Answer Text :
"P3936123470" "Alright."
// Page Squad Text :
"P1493883" "Yes! That I am. We in the Powers Division want to really make a push to show our true might, flex our muscles, if you will. Who better to do it than you, the {Hero.gender=male man|woman} who saved Eddie Polstra, amongst other claims to fame? You've been assigned five members of Powers Division, all who will follow your orders.<br><br>Their names are <color yellow>Riptide, Zane, Aria, Stern, and Warrant.</color><br><br>They're all waiting to be deployed, so when you're ready, speak with me again and we can begin."
// Answer Text :
"P2868661889" "Will do."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


