// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3141554025" "Wardog"
// ProfessionString :
"P2112241186" "Resistance Cell Captain"
// DescriptionString :
"P807329242" "Wardog is known to people in the Resistance as being wrapped in a mystery. Most who remember Wardog's true past are long dead. One thing is for sure; Wardog is a dangerous man, determined to do whatever it takes to win."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P895109320" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Wardog.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1368516386" "Let's make sure we're the victors in this war, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2360938625" "History will be made and preserved today, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1256463473" "We have nothing to discuss at the moment. You should work with the others first."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3262920647" "War knows many faces and many creeds, but when I look at you I don't see a {hero.gender=male man|woman} who has seen war. Are you sure you're where you belong?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3530047559" "{HeroName}, let's keep this introduction brief. You and I both have many things to get done, like all great figures in history. Let me just say that I consider the two of us equals here in the Resistance. We both are going to do what it takes to get things done. And, after all the help you've given to the others, we sit on the edge of a moment that will change the face of Praetoria forever."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P268055597" "The folly of many great men in history has been doing too much at once. Don't be like them, {HeroName}."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P3425726011" "History has shown only those who are truly devoted to a cause can be trusted. You, {HeroName}, are not currently one of those people."
// IntroString :
"P81335705" "Wardog has been fightin' this war for a long time. He never speaks about his past, though. Maybe that'll change with you, who knows?"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2940999568" "Wardog is the head of our cell here in Imperial, he's got everything mapped out from beginning to end."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

